<title>UK: Flemings names Russia investment banking head.</title>
<headline>Flemings names Russia investment banking head.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Robert Fleming &amp; Co said on Wednesday it had appointed Ralf-Dieter Montag-Girmes to lead its new investment banking operation in Russia.</p>
<p>Montag-Grimes is the former first deputy director general of the Russian Privatisation Centre. Flemings said he would be joined by Michael Butrin, the former head of privatisation at the centre.</p>
<p>Both will be based at Flemings' office in Moscow and will be responsible for winning capital markets and M&amp;A mandates for the group.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +171 542 5887</p>
